Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ub_comm_queue): consolidate queue safety fixes

42e0a257b09ad1bc19b6027dc79815c56f28bf56 fix(ub_comm_queue): clamp dequeue body_length to prevent OOB read
71c8bd374cec2a92be34a82e128cb53226e3c31b fix(ub_comm_queue): reject out-of-range node_id to prevent OOB access
d9c59e01d861804f0a59fcaa92874a24320828a8 fix(ub_comm_queue): tolerate dispatcher CPU affinity failures
ea0bef413ed9ac0e63cd398c6b96e6f41dfe1a4b fix(ub_comm_queue): contain asynchronous dispatch allocation and enqueue errors
3cedee9fd466e629800f9b69293d57f4f9ef0743 fix(ub_comm_queue): validate heartbeat timeout against polling interval
